{"schema_version":1,"id":"d59f23nzuarr","type":"work","subtype":"article","title":"初並天下議帝號令","authors":[{"name":"嬴政","dynasty":"秦","role":"作","entity_id":"hixhd2h9bhln"}],"resources":[{"id":"wikisource","name":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%88%9D%E4%B8%A6%E5%A4%A9%E4%B8%8B%E8%AD%B0%E5%B8%9D%E8%99%9F%E4%BB%A4&action=edit&redlink=1","types":["text"]}],"related_works":[{"id":"d59f2mpwwagx","title":"正續古文辭類纂","relation":"collected_in"}],"updated_at":"2026-08-06T22:59:42+00:00","_has_text":true,"period":"qin-han","period_basis":"據 authors[0].dynasty「秦」","description":{"text":"秦始皇二十六年（前221）初並天下，令丞相御史議帝號：王綰、馮劫、李斯等議上尊號曰「泰皇」，制曰「去泰著皇，采上古帝位號，號曰皇帝」，並追尊莊襄王、除諡法、自稱始皇帝。載《史記·秦始皇本紀》，為帝制名號之始之第一手文獻。","sources":["史記"]},"ai_note":"2026-08-23 秦代推進：description 由空補寫，所據為《史記》所載與通行學術常識。文載《史記》故今存，loss_status 依例不設；石之存毀記於 desc，石乃實物非 Work，不入存佚軸。","revision":"1.0.0","revised_at":"2026-08-24","has_text":true,"_path":"Work/a/r/r/d59f23nzuarr-初並天下議帝號令.json","_isDraft":false}